          {
            "title": "Left table",
            "id": 118583,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando usi <code>RIGHT JOIN</code>, vengono selezionate solo le righe corrispondenti della tabella a sinistra, insieme a tutte le righe della tabella a destra.</p><p>Qui, la tabella a sinistra è <code>courses</code>, poiché la tabella a sinistra è sempre la tabella nella nostra istruzione <code>SELECT</code>.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE students( &#xA; name varchar(255), &#xA; student_id int, &#xA; course_id int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE courses( &#xA; course_name varchar(255), &#xA; course_id int, &#xA; duration_in_years int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO students(name, student_id, course_id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Pat&quot;, 234, 112); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO students(name, student_id, course_id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Reagan&quot;, 098, 102); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO students(name, student_id, course_id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Ash&quot;, 712, 212); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO courses(course_name, course_id, duration_in_years) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Anthropology&quot;, 102, 3); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO courses(course_name, course_id, duration_in_years) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Liberal Arts&quot;, 112, 4); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO courses(course_name, course_id, duration_in_years) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Gender Studies&quot;, 202, 2);\"><tables><table name=\"students\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"student_id\" /><header content=\"course_id\" /></row><row><data content=\"Pat\" /><data content=\"234\" /><data content=\"112\" /></row><row><data content=\"Reagan\" /><data content=\"98\" /><data content=\"102\" /></row><row><data content=\"Ash\" /><data content=\"712\" /><data content=\"212\" /></row></table><table name=\"courses\"><row><header content=\"course_name\" /><header content=\"course_id\" /><header content=\"duration_in_years\" /></row><row><data content=\"Anthropology\" /><data content=\"102\" /><data content=\"3\" /></row><row><data content=\"Liberal Arts\" /><data content